# Under the Fallen Oak — Gravehollow before the fight: D minor; the shadows' motif slowed on an
# organ over the roots' tremolo, voices on the fifth, one bell tolling. Original, cb17
# (2026-10-29). 5 bars of 4/4 at 60: 20 s, a loop; the alpha's theme replaces it in the fight.
title Under the Fallen Oak
cue replace fade 9
tempo 60
meter 4/4
part roots strings pp pan -20 gain 10
part voices choir pp pan 20 gain 7
part shadow organ p pan 10 gain 7
part toll bells p pan -35 gain 3
bar 1
roots D2,A2/1*
voices D4,A4/1~
shadow D4/2 Eb4/2
toll D3/4 r/2.
bar 2
roots D2,A2/1*
voices D4,A4/1
shadow D4/2 A3/2
bar 3
roots Bb1,F2/1*
voices D4,A4/2 Eb4,A4/2
toll D3/4 r/2.
bar 4
roots A1,E2/1*
voices D4,A4/1
shadow F4/2 Eb4/2
bar 5
roots D2,A2/2.* r/4
voices D4,A4/2. r/4
shadow D4/2. r/4
